  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ashfoxs-point-blank-recipes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/966215/description_49beeae9-64c4-4cfe-bd50-df267928142e.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"311\"></a></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>В этом моде представлено несколько комплектов оружия и множество комплектов боеприпасов, которые можно скрафтить в оружие и патроны с помощью верстака. {Требуется мод Polymorph}</strong></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em>Необходимые моды:</em></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vics-point-blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> </a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/847/183/638246399784227999.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"187\" height=\"187\"> </a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/polymorph\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/279/271/637277042531842540.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"170\" height=\"170\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/29/69/635838945588716414.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"162\" height=\"162\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vics-point-blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/932/32/638406203730800557.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"168\" height=\"168\"></a><img src=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vics-point-blank\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em>{Необязательно} Совместимость</em></strong>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Version 8.0.0+</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/elite-x-warfare\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/949/265/638437211281037830.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"155\" height=\"155\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">до версии 8.0.0:</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/vpb-fallout-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/943/68/638426041833066304.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"127\" height=\"127\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/vics-point-blank-roc-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/944/361/638428232097840919.png\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/vics-point-blank-handguns-galore\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/943/398/638426562794706010.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"114\" height=\"114\"></a> &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/biggies-iron\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/941/149/638422186368316473.png\" width=\"111\" height=\"111\"></a> &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-addons/vpb-raygun\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/937/956/638416672917960455.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"114\" height=\"114\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">-</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em>Демонстрация {устарело}</em></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em><span><span><iframe style=\"width:601px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/wGyXFrPpjss?si=y3CrUNO8oOPomfXR\" width=\"601\" height=\"337\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></em></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">-</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">-&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">-</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">-</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Можно ли использовать его в сборке модов?&nbsp; Конечно, можно!</p>",
